---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import LogoBadge from '../components/LogoBadge.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { leadership, memberships } from '../data/profile';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import dpphPhoto from '../assets/research/dpph-assay-series.jpg';
---
<Base title="About" description="The story behind Abdulla Al Baki Rafat's path in plant science, his goals, leadership and creative interests.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>
    <div class="container head-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">About</span>
        <h1 class="reveal">Hi, I'm Rafat.</h1>
        <p class="reveal">I studied agriculture and crop botany at Sylhet Agricultural University, worked three years with U.S. healthcare teams, and I'm now preparing to return to research through an MS/PhD in plant science.</p>
        <div class="affil reveal"><LogoBadge name="sau" size={44} link /><span><strong>Sylhet Agricultural University</strong><span class="mono">B.Sc. Agriculture 2022 · M.Sc. Crop Botany 2023</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <img class="portrait reveal" src={site.photo} alt={`Portrait of ${site.name}`} loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section story-sec">
    <div class="container story">
      <div class="chapter reveal">
        <span class="mono step">June 2022</span>
        <h2>The flood</h2>
        <p>My first master's experiment was 600 black pepper stem cuttings in a randomized block trial, testing whether a rooting hormone and a copper fungicide could improve their survival. Then the worst floods Sylhet had seen in over a century took every one of them. Standing at that empty plot, I stopped seeing plants only as crops to propagate. I started seeing them as living systems that have to survive floods, drought and other extremes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter reveal">
        <span class="mono step">2022 – 2023</span>
        <h2>Starting again</h2>
        <p>Rather than lose a year, I designed a new study on how irrigation and fertilizer regimes change the black pepper berry's nutrients, vitamins and antioxidant chemistry, funded by an NST Fellowship. My department lacked many of the instruments I needed, so I adapted protocols and ran analyses in the labs of three other departments. The work won a Best Oral Presentation award in 2024.</p>
        <a href="/research#research-gallery" class="ch-photo"><Image src={dpphPhoto} alt="DPPH antioxidant assay tubes from the M.Sc. research" width={900} quality={75} format="webp" /><span class="mono">DPPH antioxidant assay · see more lab photos →</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter reveal">
        <span class="mono step">2023 – 2026</span>
        <h2>Data and people</h2>
        <p>After my M.Sc., family responsibilities meant I needed to earn, and Bangladesh has very few research positions for new graduates. As a Credentialing Analyst for a U.S. healthcare staffing partner, I worked with clinicians and state licensing boards, analysed operational data in Excel and Power BI, trained new analysts in two countries, and was named Employee of the Month four times. Those years sharpened my discipline with data and people, and made it clear that research is the work I want to return to.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter reveal">
        <span class="mono step">Next</span>
        <h2>The goal</h2>
        <p>In the short term, I want to do independent research during graduate study under a dedicated mentor and build skills in experimental design, data analysis and publishing. In the long term, I want to return to Bangladesh to teach and do research, and one day build a plant science institute where fresh graduates can start research careers with experienced mentors — the opportunity I could not find after my M.Sc.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeader eyebrow="Leadership & service" title="Outside the classroom" />
      <div class="lead-grid">
        {leadership.map((l) => (
          <div class="card hover reveal">
            <LogoBadge name={l.logo} size={56} />
            <h3>{l.org}</h3>
            <p class="mono role">{l.role}</p>
            <p class="muted">{l.text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="members reveal">
        <span class="mono label">Professional memberships</span>
        <ul>{memberships.map((m) => <li>{m}</li>)}</ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <SectionHeader eyebrow="Creative side" title="Photography, design & building things" lead="I have always been drawn to photography, editing and design. That habit now extends to building websites and apps — Doctor Kothay is one of them." />
      <div class="cta reveal">
        <a href="/projects" class="btn primary">See my projects <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
        <a href="/photography" class="btn"><Icon name="camera" /> Photography</a>
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="btn"><Icon name="mail" /> Say hello</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .head-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .portrait { border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 25%; width: 100%; max-width: 340px; justify-self: end; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -40px var(--glow); }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .head-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; } .portrait { justify-self: start; max-width: 240px; } }
  .story-sec { padding-top: 40px; }
  .story { max-width: 820px; display: grid; gap: 56px; border-left: 1px solid var(--border-strong); padding-left: 36px; }
  .chapter { position: relative; }
  .chapter::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: -42px; top: 6px; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--accent); }
  .step { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .chapter h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 6px 0 12px; }
  .chapter p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 1.04rem; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .story { padding-left: 24px; } .chapter::before { left: -30px; } }
  .affil { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .affil > span { display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .affil .mono { font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  .ch-photo { display: block; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); position: relative; }
  .ch-photo img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 8; object-fit: cover; }
  .ch-photo span { position: absolute; left: 12px; bottom: 12px; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(4,10,7,.72); color: #cfe9d9; }
  .alt { background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--bg-2) 20%, var(--bg-2) 80%, transparent); }
  .lead-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .lead-grid :global(svg) { color: var(--accent); }
  .lead-grid h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 16px 0 6px; }
  .role { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent-2); margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .lead-grid p.muted { margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .lead-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .members { margin-top: 24px; padding: 22px 26px; border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius); }
  .label { font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--accent-2); }
  .members ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted); }
  .narrow { max-width: 860px; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
